{
  "info": {
    "name": "Kirim-Chiqim nazorati API",
    "description": "# Kirim-Chiqim nazorati API\n\nShaxsiy moliya nazorati uchun Django REST API.\n\n## Boshlash\n1. `baseUrl` o'zgaruvchisini tekshiring (standart: `http://127.0.0.1:8000`).\n2. **1. Autentifikatsiya > Register** (yoki **Login**) ni ishga tushiring — access va refresh tokenlar avtomatik saqlanadi.\n3. Tartib bilan: Kategoriyalar -> Hamyonlar -> Tranzaksiyalar -> Statistika.\n\n## Autentifikatsiya\nBearer Token: `{{access}}` (collection darajasida o'rnatilgan). Access 30 daqiqa, refresh 7 kun amal qiladi; muddati tugasa **Refresh token** so'rovini ishga tushiring.\n\n## Xatolar\n- `400` — validatsiya xatosi (masalan, mablag' yetarli emas)\n- `401` — token yo'q yoki noto'g'ri\n- `404` — obyekt topilmadi (yoki boshqa foydalanuvchiniki)\n\nSwagger: `{{baseUrl}}/api/docs/`  |  ReDoc: `{{baseUrl}}/api/redoc/`",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{access}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://127.0.0.1:8000"
    },
    {
      "key": "access",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "refresh",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "incomeCategoryId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "expenseCategoryId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "walletId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "transactionId",
      "value": ""
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Autentifikatsiya",
      "description": "Ro'yxatdan o'tish, kirish va profil. Login token'ni avtomatik `token` o'zgaruvchisiga saqlaydi.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Register",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register/",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "auth",
                "register"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Yangi foydalanuvchi yaratadi va token qaytaradi.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"ali\",\n  \"email\": \"ali@example.com\",\n  \"first_name\": \"Ali\",\n  \"last_name\": \"Valiyev\",\n  \"password\": \"Str0ng-pass-123\",\n  \"password2\": \"Str0ng-pass-123\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 201', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(201); });",
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('access', json.access);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('refresh', json.refresh);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
